  <translations>
    <en>
      <description>Rain Bird LFV-075-9V is a low-flow solenoid valve for drip irrigation, fitted with a 9 V DC latching solenoid for battery-powered controllers. Its specialised diaphragm is designed for reliable operation at low flow, and the external manual bleed simplifies flushing during commissioning. LFV series specifications: 3/4″ connection; approximate flow 0.6–37.8 l/min; operating pressure 1.0–10.3 bar.</description>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>b0</_key>
