          <text>Purpose and operating principle</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>p1</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>p10</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>The controller energises the solenoid, which operates the diaphragm and opens the water passage. When the signal stops, the valve closes automatically. The LFV series is designed specifically for drip irrigation and low flow. Its specialised diaphragm and seat design support reliable shut-off at low flow rates.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>h2</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>h20</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Construction and model-specific features</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>p2</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>p20</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>The specialised diaphragm is designed to control small flows in drip-irrigation zones. The specialised diaphragm is designed for low flow; the 9 V DC latching solenoid requires a compatible battery controller.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
