          <marks>strong</marks>
          <text>Size ¾″; operating pressure 1,0–10,3 bar; flow 0,6–30,0 l/min (0,2–8 GPM); solenoid 9 V DC latching. Actual flow depends on pipe, filter and fitting losses as well as available pressure.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
