          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Connection: ¾″ female thread. Before installation, confirm flow direction, operating pressure and thread standard. Fit the valve in an accessible valve box and flush the pipework before commissioning. During service, inspect the diaphragm, pilot filter, solenoid and seals. LFV is specifically designed for low-flow operation. Select filter type and placement according to the LFV instructions and water quality.</text>
